  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool, weighted) achieves 0.639 accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more complex image encoder) while keeping other components identical. This clarifies whether the image encoder choice significantly impacts performance. The expected cost is higher than config_001 (likely ~12-15 GPU hours) but offers potential for improvement, balancing exploration of critical design choices with exploitation of similar architecture."
}

